abstract: >-
  DepAC (Deposition of Airborne Compounds) is a scientific
  Fortran library and toolkit for modeling atmospheric
  deposition processes. Developed by RIVM, DepAC provides
  robust routines for calculating dry deposition velocities,
  resistances, conductances, and compensation points for a
  specific set of chemical species and land use types.
